  "sourcePath": "../../vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act5d0/level_act5d0_03_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "d6286b5ac16a178982c1ef3af0da6c4936677d8f4901f07bf49d1b2cd81283ed",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "第二关（前）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我被擊落了？從橋上？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "離地面有多高？敵人從哪裡發動的攻擊？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不，比起那個，我現在應該——！"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_park"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唔——！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "噗哈！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "得、得救了。這是......？呃，好黏。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是安魂夜的裝飾蠟燭？謝天謝地，正好堆在這裡......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你角上也卡著一支喔。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呃？謝、謝謝，得把這個拔下來，唔——！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "蠟燭先生，先不要動。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "安靜，躲到箱子後面去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑幫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_031",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "弗倫佐的通訊斷了，應該就在這附近！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑幫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_031",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "企鵝物流也在這兒，發現目標立刻通知首領！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可以出來了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊、好......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "雖然很感謝你的幫助，但我不能把你捲進來，所以請快點離開這裡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我也想啊，難得回一趟龍門，但畢竟有委託嘛......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "看你這副狼狽樣，和企鵝物流打交道很辛苦吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......很辛苦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那麼，你是誰？你不是普通的路人吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "也不用這麼緊張，總之，我不是你的敵人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "等等，他們又來了，先躲好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑幫A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_031",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "娘咧，弗倫佐果然被企鵝物流抓到了。我們怎麼辦？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑幫B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_031",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那個叫拜松的豐蹄小子落單了，這是個大好機會。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑幫A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_031",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但這裡已經是市區了，我們還能動手嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑幫B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_031",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "卡彭先生都考慮過了，只要不動明火，做得隱秘一點，龍門是不會管的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑幫B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_031",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "沒有人會特地去關照那些散發著垃圾臭味的小街暗巷吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑幫A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_031",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "明白了，那我們去救人，你們去找人，沒問題吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "看來這裡已經不能久留了呢，我們得離開這裡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "讓我看看......在那兒呢，打個招呼吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可頌",
      "speakerId": "char_201_moeshd",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "老闆，找到拜松了嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大帝",
      "speakerId": "char_105_emper",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我戴的是墨鏡，不是望遠鏡，別催我！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大帝",
      "speakerId": "char_105_emper",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊......看見了。在向我招手呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那我們快去把他接回來吧，然後再來問問這個傢伙，他們在打什麼主意。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑幫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_031",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唔——唔唔——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大帝",
      "speakerId": "char_105_emper",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大帝",
      "speakerId": "char_105_emper",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "看來我們幸運的實習生恰好摔在了一個安全的地方，他會自己回來的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可頌",
      "speakerId": "char_201_moeshd",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯......從十二米高空自由落體到了一個安全的地方？怎麼個安全法？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "而且他也是敵人的目標之一喔，真的不管他嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大帝",
      "speakerId": "char_105_emper",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "有她在。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......她回來了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克薩斯",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "能天使，別分神。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑幫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_031",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他們在那裡！去把弗倫佐救回來！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哎呀，好像的確有點抽不開身呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "熱熱鬧鬧地走掉了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "所以，德克薩斯他們又惹了什麼麻煩？這次是和誰打架？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我該信任你嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "也是，自我介紹一下，我是企鵝物流的信使，莫斯提馬。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提馬",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "姑且算是你的同行吧，不過我更喜歡自己行動多一點。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......莫斯提馬，我在父親那裡聽過這個名字。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（而且，長著漆黑雙角的薩科塔......原來這個傳聞是真的，不，還是不要問了吧......）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提馬",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯......好事還是壞事呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不，怎麼說，都是些不可思議的傳聞......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "而且你剛才幫了我，也許我不該懷疑你的，抱歉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提馬",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "沒關係的，你不用這麼拘謹。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "謝謝......總之，我們應該先共用一下情報......雖然我也是一頭霧水。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......簡而言之，企鵝物流和一支敘拉古黑手黨發生了矛盾。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提馬",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯，我大概明白了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "欸？這就明白了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提馬",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "沒必要顧慮那麼多，適當地放棄思考，放縱本心，才能跟上企鵝物流的節奏喔。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呃，原來訣竅是放棄思考嗎......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提馬",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "畢竟他們真的很特別，常識是不起作用的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......莫斯提馬小姐也是？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提馬",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "一般會這麼直接地問本人嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好、好像是這樣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提馬",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "總之，我們得先離開這裡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提馬",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "跟我來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_lmstreet_1"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑幫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_031",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "喂！還沒有發現目標嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑幫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_031",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "該死，這裡人太多了，搞什麼！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑幫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_031",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "走，我們去其它地方！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......他們好像沒發現我們。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提馬",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "就這樣保持下去，然後想辦法和德克薩斯他們匯合。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提馬",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唔。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "怎、怎麼了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提馬",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這個方向，前面的難道是......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "被、被敵人發現了！？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提馬",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "原來是這裡，這麼多年沒有回過龍門，名字都換了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提馬",
      "speakerId": "char_213_mostma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯......你想不想吃點什麼？我想想，抹茶還是巧克力？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
